OL,3,GNEWSADriver who caused death of
OL,4,AOlympian sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA van driver who caused the death of a
OL,7,FBritish Olympian on a North Yorkshire
OL,8,Froad has been given a suspended jail
OL,9,Fsentence.
OL,11,FBradley McStravick, who competed as a
OL,12,Fdecathlete alongside teammate Daley
OL,13,FThompson in the 1980 and 1984 Summer
OL,14,FOlympics, was knocked off his bike on
OL,15,Fthe B6165 in Burnt Yates on 20 August
OL,16,F2024.
OL,18,FYork Magistrates' Court heard the
OL,19,F68-year-old had been given the
OL,20,Fall-clear from cancer earlier the same
OL,21,Fday, with the cyclist airlifted to
OL,22,Fhospital where he later died.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
